// {0} - взаимодействие, {1} - карта, {2} - игроки, {3} - ПНВ (LoadingUI подставляет бинды)
Tip_1 Place a Tool Cupboard first: strangers can't build within its radius
Tip_2 Keep wood and wall materials in the cupboard, or your base will start to decay
Tip_3 Explosives can't hurt a cupboard, only weapons and tools can. Hide it deep
Tip_4 Upgrade with the Mallet: wood, stone, metal, HQM - each tier is tougher
Tip_5 A Code Lock lets your group in, a Solo Lock lets in only you
Tip_6 Turrets only work within range of a fueled generator, no wires needed
Tip_7 Generators are fueled with Low Grade Fuel straight from your inventory
Tip_8 Put matching ammo into a turret and it will reload by itself
Tip_9 Break someone's wall or door and you get a raid block: no building, no teleport
Tip_10 Hurting a player starts a combat block: no going home until it ends
Tip_11 Press {0} on a bed or sleeping bag to make it your home
Tip_12 Teleport home from the map {1}. Not available in vehicles or under a block
Tip_13 Request a teleport to a friend from the player list {2} if the server has TPA
Tip_14 Create a group in the player list {2}: pick a player and invite them
Tip_15 Put an item and scrap into the Research Table: the item burns, the blueprint stays
Tip_16 At the workbench you learn blueprints for scrap along the tech tree
Tip_17 Learned items can only be crafted near a workbench of the right level
Tip_18 Break roadside barrels: they hold components and scrap
Tip_19 Recycle components to get scrap and resources
Tip_20 Hit the X on trees and the glowing spot on rocks for a bigger yield
Tip_21 The Jackhammer always hits the bonus spot: the best tool for ore
Tip_22 You can chop cacti for cloth
Tip_23 Furnaces burn wood and smelt ore into metal and sulfur, leaving charcoal
Tip_24 Gunpowder is made of charcoal and sulfur. Don't toss your charcoal
Tip_25 Bandages stop bleeding, syringes restore health fast
Tip_26 Watch your food and water: hunger and thirst kill slowly but surely
Tip_27 A hazmat suit keeps you safe in radiation zones
Tip_28 Turn on night vision with {3}: nights and tunnels are hard without it
Tip_29 After death your gear waits in a box where you fell, but not for long
Tip_30 When you log off you leave a sleeper that can be looted. Log off at home
Tip_31 A keycard opens monument doors of its color and lasts 5 uses
Tip_32 A locked crate opens 8 minutes after you hack it. Hold your ground
Tip_33 A supply signal calls an airdrop where it lands
Tip_34 The MLRS needs an aim module and rockets, and you pick the target on the map
Tip_35 Weapons don't work in the safe town, and turrets won't fire there
Tip_36 Free kits are in the pause menu Shop tab, each with its own cooldown
Tip_37 See which items are still wipe-blocked on the Block tab of the pause menu
Tip_38 Spotted a cheater? Report them on the Reports tab of the pause menu
Tip_39 In the evening you can vote for daytime: watch for the prompt on screen
Tip_40 Trust no one: even an unarmed player can be a threat
